{"seq":2,"slug":"corrosion-protection","title":"腐蚀与防护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/applications/corrosion-protection","wordCount":1973,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"腐蚀与防护\">腐蚀与防护</h1><p>腐蚀是电化学最昂贵的一面——全球每年因金属腐蚀造成的损失约占 GDP 的 3%~4%。它的本质并不神秘：一块金属浸在潮湿环境里，表面不同位置自发形成了无数个微型原电池，金属一处被氧化溶解、另一处发生还原，电流在金属内部悄悄流动，金属就这样被「自己」消耗掉。理解腐蚀就是把 <a href=\"../fundamentals/redox-electrode-potential\">氧化还原与电极电势</a> 和 <a href=\"../kinetics/electrode-kinetics\">电极反应动力学</a> 反过来用——不是要发电，而是要阻止这种「不请自来的电池」。本篇讲清腐蚀的电化学机理、混合电位与腐蚀速率的测定、以及三大类防护策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>电化学腐蚀的核心是金属表面同时存在阳极区和阴极区，构成「腐蚀微电池」。阳极区金属被氧化溶解（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Fe} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{Fe^{2+}} + 2e^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Fe</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），阴极区发生还原——在中性含氧环境是吸氧反应（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{O_2} + 2\\mathrm{H_2O} + 4e^- \\rightarrow 4\\mathrm{OH^-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），在酸性环境是析氢反应（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\mathrm{H^+} + 2e^- \\rightarrow \\mathrm{H_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8547em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。两个区域电位不同，构成 <a href=\"../fundamentals/redox-electrode-potential\">氧化还原与电极电势</a> 里讲的原电池，只不过这次发电是有害的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[金属浸于潮湿环境] --&gt; B[表面不均匀]&#10;  B --&gt; C[阳极区&lt;br/&gt;金属氧化溶解]&#10;  B --&gt; D[阴极区&lt;br/&gt;吸氧或析氢还原]&#10;  C --&gt; E[腐蚀微电池]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[混合电位/腐蚀电位]&#10;  F --&gt; G[腐蚀电流 = 腐蚀速率]&#10;  G --&gt; H[防护:三大策略]\">flowchart TD\n  A[金属浸于潮湿环境] --&gt; B[表面不均匀]\n  B --&gt; C[阳极区&lt;br/&gt;金属氧化溶解]\n  B --&gt; D[阴极区&lt;br/&gt;吸氧或析氢还原]\n  C --&gt; E[腐蚀微电池]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[混合电位/腐蚀电位]\n  F --&gt; G[腐蚀电流 = 腐蚀速率]\n  G --&gt; H[防护:三大策略]</pre><p>下表归纳常见腐蚀类型及其成因：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>腐蚀类型</th>\n<th>成因</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>均匀腐蚀</td>\n<td>整体表面均匀氧化</td>\n<td>钢铁在大气中生锈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电偶腐蚀</td>\n<td>两种电位不同的金属接触</td>\n<td>钢铁螺栓接铜件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点蚀</td>\n<td>钝化膜局部破坏</td>\n<td>不锈钢遇氯离子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缝隙腐蚀</td>\n<td>缝隙内氧浓差电池</td>\n<td>法兰垫片、焊缝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应力腐蚀</td>\n<td>拉应力 + 腐蚀环境协同</td>\n<td>高强钢、奥氏体不锈钢</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"混合电位与腐蚀速率\">混合电位与腐蚀速率</h2><p>一块自由腐蚀的金属，其电位既不是阳极反应的平衡电位、也不是阴极反应的平衡电位，而是两者动力学相互妥协后达到的「混合电位」——也叫腐蚀电位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>corr</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{corr}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">corr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。在这个电位下，阳极氧化电流恰好等于阴极还原电流（无外部电流流过金属表面净电荷为零），这个相等的电流值就是腐蚀电流 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mtext>corr</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_{\\text{corr}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">corr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它正比于腐蚀速率。</p>\n<p>腐蚀速率的测定直接用上 <a href=\"../kinetics/electrode-kinetics\">电极反应动力学</a> 的塔费尔方程。把阳极和阴极的塔费尔直线分别外推，两线交点的横坐标就给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>lg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mtext>corr</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lg i_{\\text{corr}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">l<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">corr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、纵坐标给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>corr</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{corr}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">corr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这种「塔费尔外推法」是实验室测腐蚀速率的标准手段。此外，线性极化电阻法（在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>corr</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{corr}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">corr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 附近测电流-电位斜率，斜率反比于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mtext>corr</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_{\\text{corr}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">corr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）和 <a href=\"electroanalytical\">电化学分析方法</a> 里的交流阻抗谱，都是无损监测腐蚀进程的常用技术。</p>\n<p>许多看似纯化学的腐蚀，根子在 <a href=\"../fundamentals/nernst-equation\">能斯特方程</a> 描述的浓差电池：缝隙腐蚀就是缝内外氧浓度不同形成浓差电池，缺氧的缝内成阳极被加速腐蚀；点蚀同理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"钝化-金属的自我保护\">钝化：金属的自我保护</h2><p>有些金属（铝、钛、不锈钢）在特定条件下会在表面生成一层致密、附着牢固的氧化膜，把金属与环境隔开，使腐蚀速率骤降几个数量级，这就是钝化。钝化膜的本质与 <a href=\"../batteries/lithium-ion\">锂离子电池原理</a> 里的 SEI 膜异曲同工——都是界面上自发生成的保护层。不锈钢之所以「不锈」，正是铬含量超过约 12% 后形成富铬钝化膜的功劳。</p>\n<p>但钝化膜并非万无一失。氯离子能穿透并局部击穿钝化膜，在破口处形成小阳极、周围大阴极的「大阴极小阳极」格局，导致深而隐蔽的点蚀——这是不锈钢在海洋环境失效的主因。钝化与点蚀的竞争，可以用电位-电流曲线（钝化曲线）来刻画，是材料耐蚀性评价的核心实验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三大防护策略\">三大防护策略</h2><p>工程上对抗腐蚀的手段可归为三类，分别从不同环节切断腐蚀微电池。</p>\n<p>第一类是改变金属本身或隔绝环境：选用耐蚀合金（不锈钢、钛合金）、施加涂层与镀层（油漆、塑料、电镀，见 <a href=\"electrolysis-plating\">电解与电镀</a>）、添加缓蚀剂吸附在金属表面抑制反应。第二类是阴极保护，这是电化学防护的精髓——人为把被保护金属强制变成阴极，从而停止其阳极溶解。</p>\n<p>阴极保护又分两种。牺牲阳极法：把电位更低的活泼金属（锌、镁、铝）与被保护钢铁连接，活泼金属作阳极优先腐蚀、钢铁作阴极受保护，船体、地下管道、热水器内胆广泛使用。外加电流法：用外接直流电源把被保护金属接到负极、强制其成为阴极，适用于大型设施如海洋平台、长输管道。第三类是阳极保护：对可钝化金属施加阳极电流使其进入并维持钝化区，用于储存强腐蚀介质的不锈钢设备。</p>\n<h2 id=\"防护的电化学逻辑\">防护的电化学逻辑</h2><p>把三大策略放回 <a href=\"../fundamentals/redox-electrode-potential\">氧化还原与电极电势</a> 的框架，逻辑就清晰了：腐蚀的驱动力是阳极区与阴极区的电位差，腐蚀速率由 <a href=\"../kinetics/electrode-kinetics\">电极反应动力学</a> 决定。阴极保护通过外部供电子，把金属电位拉到阳极溶解不再发生的区域；钝化和涂层通过制造高阻隔界面，把腐蚀电流降到极低；缓蚀剂则提高反应的活化过电位。每一种手段都对应着把腐蚀微电池的某个环节「关掉」，这正是腐蚀工程师的思维方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"电位-ph-图-腐蚀的-地图\">电位-pH 图：腐蚀的「地图」</h2><p>要预判某金属在给定环境下到底会腐蚀、钝化还是稳定，工程上有一张强大的工具——电位-pH 图（Pourbaix 图）。它以电极电位为纵轴、溶液 pH 为横轴，把金属-水体系划分成三类区域：免蚀区（金属热力学稳定，不腐蚀）、腐蚀区（金属以离子形式溶解）、钝化区（生成稳定氧化物或氢氧化物保护膜）。</p>\n<p>这张图本质上是 <a href=\"../fundamentals/redox-electrode-potential\">氧化还原与电极电势</a> 与 <a href=\"../fundamentals/nernst-equation\">能斯特方程</a> 的图形化：每条边界线都是某个半反应在不同 pH 下平衡电位的轨迹，斜线对应同时涉及电子和质子的反应（电位随 pH 变化），水平线对应只涉及电子的反应。把前面讲的三大防护策略放到这张图上，逻辑立刻清晰：阴极保护就是把金属电位向下拉进免蚀区，阳极保护则是把电位向上推进钝化区，调节 pH（如加碱）则是水平移动到钝化区。</p>\n<p>但 Pourbaix 图只讲热力学「会不会」，不讲动力学「有多快」——它无法预测腐蚀速率，也未考虑氯离子击穿钝化膜导致的点蚀。所以它是判断方向的地图，真正的速率仍需回到 <a href=\"../kinetics/electrode-kinetics\">电极反应动力学</a> 的塔费尔分析。两者结合，才是完整的腐蚀评估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>电化学腐蚀本质是金属表面自发形成腐蚀微电池，阳极区金属溶解、阴极区吸氧或析氢还原。</li>\n<li>自由腐蚀电位是混合电位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>corr</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{corr}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">corr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，此时阳极电流等于阴极电流即腐蚀电流 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mtext>corr</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_{\\text{corr}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">corr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，正比于腐蚀速率。</li>\n<li>腐蚀速率用塔费尔外推、线性极化电阻、交流阻抗谱测定；缝隙腐蚀与点蚀源于氧浓差电池。</li>\n<li>钝化膜与 SEI 同源，是自发生成的保护层；氯离子击穿钝化膜导致点蚀，是不锈钢海洋失效主因。</li>\n<li>三大防护策略——隔绝/缓蚀、阴极保护（牺牲阳极/外加电流）、阳极保护——分别从电位差、界面阻隔、过电位三处切断腐蚀微电池。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"腐蚀与防护","id":"腐蚀与防护"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"混合电位与腐蚀速率","id":"混合电位与腐蚀速率"},{"level":2,"text":"钝化：金属的自我保护","id":"钝化-金属的自我保护"},{"level":2,"text":"三大防护策略","id":"三大防护策略"},{"level":2,"text":"防护的电化学逻辑","id":"防护的电化学逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"电位-pH 图：腐蚀的「地图」","id":"电位-ph-图-腐蚀的-地图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"电化学分析方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/applications/electroanalytical"},"next":{"title":"电解与电镀","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/applications/electrolysis-plating"}}